        "candidate_id": "C_5353d594baa577fe_2",
        "edit": "Fix the case statement in the always block: the four case items all used the same selector 2'b00, so only input a was ever selected. Change the case item labels to 2'b00, 2'b01, 2'b10, and 2'b11 so that sel correctly selects a, b, c, and d respectively.",
